ulfilled.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-49-10"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7048013","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"a4e760b2d323615f6dba10749d6b510cb16754fccfabb36090a7c20cb306dac9","compact":"0aa3efc2b6d062a0c0fe85e8462133c141dbba772064a2319971d9cbe96bf58e","nasal":"3444b3bbf84121edaf1ab8c3be70ec7b7a285b6a2efd9819872cc99e81f76df1"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-48-14","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":48,"verse":14,"english":"Saying this, She with folded hands, followed the ascetic. Beholding the great ascetic and Sītā approach, the wives, of the Rsis, delighted neared them and said. “Do you come, O foremost of Rșis, you have arrived here after a long time. We all bow to you-do you order what we shall do.\"","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.493,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-49-11"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7048014","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"b6fbc96646b5c1801e50b860607b163170b5dfdba4a0fa560f46372ff1ac95d1","compact":"802c933190ddd172101c8b8234b605ffda76915ba7f89aa943f0cb1868fe85d4","nasal":"060ad549601513cf079dd07b63eea37e169705068bd9b8a910345b0a185f851c"}},{"id":"VRCE-7-48-15","kanda":7,"kandaId":"uttara","sarga":48,"verse":15,"english":"Saying this, She with folded hands, followed the ascetic. Beholding the great ascetic and Sītā approach, the wives, of the Rsis, delighted neared them and said. “Do you come, O foremost of Rșis, you have arrived here after a long time. We all bow to you-do you order what we shall do.\"","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.773,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-7-49-11"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"7048015","sanskritFile":"Ram07.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exac